# HR-F-06 paper is locked

The Leave Request print layout is finished and must stay identical to the official Word file `EW - HR-F-06 Leave request.docx`.

Do **not** change shape, size, spacing, or print layout in `hr-leave.html`, `assets/empire-hr.css`, or the print/clone helpers in `assets/empire-hr-leave.js`.

Locked (never edit unless the user explicitly asks to unlock the paper):

- A4 portrait and `@page` margins (`7mm 16.26mm 12mm 17.51mm`)
- Logo size, title size, fonts, table widths, row heights, borders
- Section order, Approvals 4-cell row, entitlement rows, `HR-F-06` / `Rev.2` footer
- Print iframe / bake-values print path

Allowed: fill or save data, date *text* format if the user asks, and bugs that do not move or resize anything.

Start/end dates on the paper display as `31-Aug-26` (day, hyphen, title-case month, 2-digit year), centered.
